  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-40.5pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;(注) １．定量的な保有効果は個別の取引条件を開示できないため記載が困難であります。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row2Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;"&gt;２．保有の合理性は銘柄毎のリスク・リターン分析等により検証し、取締役会に報告しております。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row3Member">&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;３．㈱ふくおかフィナンシャルグループ、㈱九州フィナンシャルグループ、㈱ニップン、第一生命ホールディングス㈱は当行の株式を保有しておりませんが、同社子会社が当行の株式を保有しております。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_annoNum2" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:49.5pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-18pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;４．株式数の増加は、株式分割によるものです。&lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:FootnotesSpecifiedInvestmentSharesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompanyTextBlock>
  <jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany contextRef="CurrentYearInstant_Row1Member">三愛オブリ㈱</jpcrp_cor:NameOfSecuritiesDetailsOfDeemedHoldingsOfEquitySecuritiesHeldForPurposesOtherThanPureInvestmentReportingCompany>
